      "widgets_values": [
        "Premium children's book DIGITAL DRAWING, portrait1696x2528. Preserve the warm cream/moss/apricot palette, hand-drawn contours and luminous garden atmosphere of supplied refs, with ordinary plants, never fantasy flowers or other magical beings. INPUT ROLES: image1 approved SHARED character scale/interaction reference; image2 Shir individual identity/outfit; image3 Skitters HATCHLING identity/anatomy; image4 established Chapter1 GARDEN environment/lighting only, NOT its human proportions or egg pose; image5 rough placement map for camera and safe areas only. Canonical infant dragon has four short legs plus two wings and one tail, turquoise scales, butter-yellow belly, apricot wing undersides, ivory rounded horn buds, amber eyes, forehead gold star. Shir9, blue eyes, honey dark blonde topknot at scalp apex NOT forehead, lilac shirt, dusty rose shorts, pink sport sandals with black connectors/soles. Pink backpack rear panel print of three HUNTR/X girls exists ONLY on rear: front torso view shows straps/plain side, print fully occluded. Normal child head proportion, no oversized head. SAME dragon physical size in every pose: shoulder18cm, snout-to-rump30cm excluding tail, Shir130cm, headtop approx36cm. Use image1 relative scale; never enlarge dragon to fill page or shrink to fit sandal. Both at same depth except natural pose; keep full figure and all contact visible. Quiet PALE cream misty light TOP32 percent for HTML reading text. No baked text, lettering, speech bubbles, rulers, collage or panels. Empty expendable path/background BOTTOM12 percent for navigation; no feet, tail, flame or plot details in bottom12percent. All essential characters/action within central60percent width for phone crop. Garden clearing stone path, shrub masses, warm sunlight and subtle glow, no door or city in these interior shots. Page4 humor and attachment: Shir stands looking down in amused surprised disbelief, one hand lightly at her chest as if saying Me? Body faces viewer threequarter. Skitters beside her sandal, both FRONT paws on pink toe strap, BOTH HIND feet planted on path. Torso and tail entirely OUTSIDE sandal. Use image1 contact pose closely: he is a small puppy-sized hatchling, not a toy on her foot. Shir full body occupies x28-55percent, scalp y34percent, soles y85percent; dragon x50-75percent with headtop around70percent and feet85percent. A few broken cream-speckled eggshell pieces near shrub behind them, subtle secondary detail. No intact egg. She has natural startled smile, not terror.",
        9204,
        "fixed",
        "high",
        "opaque",
        "Custom",
        1,
        "gpt-image-2",
        1696,
        2528
